{"strongs": "H2399", "word": "חֵטְא", "translit": "chet", "root": "חזר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sin", "definition": "חֵטְא noun masculine Deut 15:9 sin (on formation see Lag BN 142 ) — ׳ ח Lev 19:17 + 15 t.; suffix חָטְאוֺ Lev 24:15 + 5 t., חֲטָאָו֯ Lam 3:39 , חֶטְאָם Lev 20:20 plural חֲטָאִים Eccl 10:4 construct חֲטָאֵי 2Kgs 10:29 ; Ezek 23:49 suffix חֲטָאַי Gen 41:9 , חֲטָאָ֑י Isa 38:17 ; Ps 51:11 , חֲטָאֵינוּ Dan 9:16 ; Ps 103:10 , חֲטָאֵיכֶם Isa 1:18 — 1. sin: \\ \\ a. against man Gen 41:9 ( E ) Eccl 10:4 . \\ \\ b. elsewhere ag. God, absolute Isa 31:7 ; Hos 12:9 חָטָא ׳ ח Lam 1:8 compare Deut 19:15 ; 2Kgs 10:29 משׁפט מות ׳ ח sin worthy of death Deut 21:22 = מות ׳ ח Deut 22:26 with בְּ , because of , Dan 9:16 God is entreated: hide thy face from my sins Ps 51:11 and it is said in faith, thou wilt cast behind thy back all my sins Isa 38:17 . 2. guilt of sin: היה חטא ב sin (the guilt of sin) come on one Deut 15:9 ; Deut 21:22 ; Deut 23:22 ; Deut 23:23 ; Deut 24:15 בחטאו מת in his sin (guilt) die Num 27:3 ( P ); אישׁ בחטאו each for his own sin Deut 24:16 = 2Kgs 14:16 = 2Chr 25:4 בחטא יחמתני אמי Ps 51:7 in sin (condition of sin and guilt) my mother conceived me ; אם חטאיכם כשׁנים Isa 1:18 though your sins be like scarlet (in guilt); לא כחטאינו עשׂה לנו Ps 103:10 not according to our sins (their guilt) hath he done to us . 3. punishment for sin: ׳ נשׂא ח bear sin (its punishment) Lev 20:20 ; Lev 24:15 ( H ), Num 9:13 ; Num 18:22 ( P ); with עַל , bear sin because of Lev 19:17 ; Lev 22:9 ( H ) Num 18:32 ( P ); bear sins of idols (in worshipping idols) Ezek 23:49 the ideal servant of Yahweh bore the sins of many Isa 53:12 without נשׂא , only Lam 3:39 גבר על חטאו (wherefore doth) a man (complain) for the punishment of his sin ?", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2695')\">BDB2695</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2399')\">H2399</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2694')\">BDB2694</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2696')\">BDB2696</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֵטְא</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Deut 15:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,9)\">Deut 15:9</ref></sup> <highlightword>sin</highlightword> (on formation see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup> BN 142</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,17)\">Lev 19:17</ref> + 15 t.; suffix <bdbheb>חָטְאוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 24:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,15)\">Lev 24:15</ref> + 5 t., <bdbheb>חֲטָאָו֯</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 3:39\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,39)\">Lam 3:39</ref>, <bdbheb>חֶטְאָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 20:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,20,20)\">Lev 20:20</ref> plural <bdbheb>חֲטָאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 10:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,4)\">Eccl 10:4</ref> construct <bdbheb>חֲטָאֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,29)\">2Kgs 10:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,49)\">Ezek 23:49</ref> suffix <bdbheb>חֲטָאַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,9)\">Gen 41:9</ref>, <bdbheb>חֲטָאָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 38:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,17)\">Isa 38:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,11)\">Ps 51:11</ref>, <bdbheb>חֲטָאֵינוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 9:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,16)\">Dan 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 103:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,10)\">Ps 103:10</ref>, <bdbheb>חֲטָאֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,18)\">Isa 1:18</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>sin:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> against man <ref ref=\"Gen 41:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,9)\">Gen 41:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Eccl 10:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,4)\">Eccl 10:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> elsewhere ag. God, absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 31:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,31,7)\">Isa 31:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 12:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,9)\">Hos 12:9</ref> <bdbheb>חָטָא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 1:8\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,8)\">Lam 1:8</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Deut 19:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,15)\">Deut 19:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,29)\">2Kgs 10:29</ref> <bdbheb>משׁפט מות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <highlight>sin</highlight> worthy of death <ref ref=\"Deut 21:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,22)\">Deut 21:22</ref> = <bdbheb>מות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 22:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,26)\">Deut 22:26</ref> with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>, <highlight>because of</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Dan 9:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,16)\">Dan 9:16</ref> God is entreated: <highlight>hide thy face from my sins</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,11)\">Ps 51:11</ref> and it is said in faith, <highlight>thou wilt cast behind thy back all my sins</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 38:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,17)\">Isa 38:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>guilt of sin:</highlight> <bdbheb>היה חטא ב</bdbheb> <highlight>sin</highlight> (the guilt of sin) <highlight>come on one</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 15:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,9)\">Deut 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 21:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,22)\">Deut 21:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,22)\">Deut 23:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,23)\">Deut 23:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 24:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,15)\">Deut 24:15</ref> <bdbheb>בחטאו מת</bdbheb> <highlight>in his sin</highlight> (guilt) <highlight>die</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 27:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,27,3)\">Num 27:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>אישׁ בחטאו</bdbheb> <highlight>each for his own sin</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,16)\">Deut 24:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,16)\">2Kgs 14:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 25:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,25,4)\">2Chr 25:4</ref> <bdbheb>בחטא יחמתני אמי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,7)\">Ps 51:7</ref> <highlight>in sin</highlight> (condition of sin and guilt) <highlight>my mother conceived me</highlight>; <bdbheb>אם חטאיכם כשׁנים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,18)\">Isa 1:18</ref> <highlight>though your sins be like scarlet</highlight> (in guilt); <bdbheb>לא כחטאינו עשׂה לנו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 103:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,10)\">Ps 103:10</ref> <highlight>not according to our sins</highlight> (their guilt) <highlight>hath he done to us</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>punishment for sin:</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נשׂא ח</bdbheb> <highlight>bear sin</highlight> (its punishment) <ref ref=\"Lev 20:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,20,20)\">Lev 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,15)\">Lev 24:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 9:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,9,13)\">Num 9:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,22)\">Num 18:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>, <highlight>bear sin because of</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,17)\">Lev 19:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 22:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,9)\">Lev 22:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Num 18:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,32)\">Num 18:32</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); bear sins of idols (in worshipping idols) <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,49)\">Ezek 23:49</ref> the ideal servant of Yahweh <highlight>bore the sins of many</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 53:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,12)\">Isa 53:12</ref> without <bdbheb>נשׂא</bdbheb>, only <ref ref=\"Lam 3:39\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,39)\">Lam 3:39</ref> <bdbheb>גבר על חטאו</bdbheb> (wherefore doth) <highlight>a man</highlight> (complain) <highlight>for the punishment of his sin ?</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 15:9", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 15, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Lev 19:17", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 19, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Lev 24:15", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 24, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Lam 3:39", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 39}, {"raw": "Lev 20:20", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 20, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Eccl 10:4", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 10, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "2Kgs 10:29", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 10, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Ezek 23:49", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 23, "verse": 49}, {"raw": "Gen 41:9", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Isa 38:17", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 38, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ps 51:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 51, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Dan 9:16", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 9, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 103:10", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 103, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Isa 1:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 31:7", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 31, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Hos 12:9", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 12, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Lam 1:8", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 19:15", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 19, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Deut 21:22"